    <div>
      <h2>What's next for the Foundation</h2>
      <p class="lede">Thirty years in, the work is to make sure the schism never turns a thousand. Three commitments for the years ahead.</p>
      <p><strong>Keep the conference affordable</strong> and bring it to more cities, so lay people, not only specialists, hear what the dialogue has agreed. <strong>Take more pilgrims to both Sees.</strong> And <strong>launch the Orientale Lumen Institute</strong>, online ecumenical education built on thirty years of recorded plenaries, so the conversation reaches people who will never sit in the room.</p>
      <a class="textlink" href="/give/">How to help →</a>
    </div>
